Rumor (T):
They say that clever wizard can have stats: 18/** 24 18 24 24 24

That is true but my playful barbarian Shay Tal got stats: 25 25 18 25 25 25

How to do that contains possible spoilers so!
^L




























After founding seven polymorph wands I started to experiment:

Polypile tools to get magic markers and use those to write blessed scrolls
of enchant armor and blessed scrolls of charging.

Polypile potions to get potions of gain ability.

Polypile armor to get gauntlets of dexterity and helmets of brilliance.

Polypile rings to get rings of gain strength and rings of adornement.

After getting stats: 18/** 18 18 18 18 18 by eating giants and quaffing
blessed potions of gain ability, start to charge the rings to get at least
+7 ring of gain strength and +7 ring of adornement. This gives you stats:
25 18 18 18 18 25 and in my case destroyed five rings. Then start to enchant
the armor to get +7 gauntlets of dexterity and +7 helmet of brilliance. This
may take awhile because the armor will disappear because of too much enchantment
but in the end you will succeed if you have enough scrolls, armor and polymorph
wands.

Voila! Now your stats are 25 25 18 25 25 25.

Why not to have item(s) to increase constitution so you could get all stats to
25?

What I wonder is how will Shay Tal die this time or will this be my first
ascension.



